{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03928","headline":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制 · 韦元旦","name":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重楼阁半山霞，四望韶阳春未赊。\n侍跸妍歌临灞涘，留觞艳舞出京华。\n危竿竞捧中街日，戏马争衔上苑花。\n景色欢娱长若此，承恩不醉不还家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}